title: After an outside change arrives during unsaved typing and the typing is undone, the clean file is the one on disk (a later edit and save keeps the outside line)
folders: edit-odd
limit: 40
forbid-log: cannot edit
expect-file: edit-odd/b.txt :: (?-i)THEIRS

wait 3000
goto b.txt
wait 800
edit b.txt 1 1
type MINE
touch b.txt THEIRS
wait 2500
key undo
wait 800
mark clean-but-stale
wait 400
key escape
wait 400
edit b.txt 2 1
type Z
key save
wait 800
mark saved
wait 400
quit
